  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Is \"is taller than\" a fair relation?",
    "kn": "\"ಇವನಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ\" ಎಂಬುದು ಯಾವ ಬಗೆಯ ಸಂಬಂಧ?"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "If Ravi is taller than Anil and Anil is taller than Sita, then Ravi is taller than Sita. But Ravi is never taller than himself. Today we name these patterns.",
    "kn": "ರವಿ ಅನಿಲನಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ, ಅನಿಲ ಸೀತಾಳಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ ಎಂದಾದರೆ ರವಿ ಸೀತಾಳಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ. ಆದರೆ ರವಿ ತನಗಿಂತ ತಾನೇ ಎತ್ತರನಲ್ಲ. ಇಂದು ಈ ಮಾದರಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹೆಸರು ಕೊಡೋಣ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Define a relation as a subset of A × A"
    },
    {
     "en": "Recognise empty and universal relations"
    },
    {
     "en": "Test a relation for reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "If Ravi is taller than Anil and Anil is taller than Sita, then Ravi is taller than Sita. But Ravi is never taller than himself. Today we name these patterns.",
    "kn": "ರವಿ ಅನಿಲನಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ, ಅನಿಲ ಸೀತಾಳಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ ಎಂದಾದರೆ ರವಿ ಸೀತಾಳಿಗಿಂತ ಎತ್ತರ. ಆದರೆ ರವಿ ತನಗಿಂತ ತಾನೇ ಎತ್ತರನಲ್ಲ. ಇಂದು ಈ ಮಾದರಿಗಳಿಗೆ ಹೆಸರು ಕೊಡೋಣ."
   }
